    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75060.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "That is really nice. Well, I see that you have recently introduced a bill along with some other senators called the Human Trafficking and Exploitation Prevention Training Act. I think it's really interesting timing as January was a human trafficking awareness month. I would like to know a little bit about this act and how it differs from some stuff that's already out there.",
