    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75060.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Well, thank you so much, Justine. And let me just start by saying that I first became really truly aware of the pervasiveness of trafficking of children. Back when I was Lieutenant Governor, and I had a chance to sit down with some young women who in their teens had become the victim of sex trafficking. And I was just",
